@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-login-token

### Weekly report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weekly-report?startDate=2026-11-02&endDate=2026-11-09&divisionId=194899&divisionId=194901&teamId=182497&teamId=182498&teamId=182220&teamId=194901
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

